-- TrialChamber_RuinsAesthetic.lua
-- Pure visual overlay for TrialChamberGeneratedV5_Sky.
-- Adds ruins vines, weeds, rubble, rust weathering, and realistic Room B water.
-- Does NOT move/resize/disable gameplay structure, traps, spawns, gates, or scripts.

